<title>VIETNAM: SOCCER-TAJIKISTAN BEAT VIETNAM 4-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TAJIKISTAN BEAT VIETNAM 4-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>HANOI 1997-06-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tajikistan beat Vietnam 4-0</p>
<p>(halftime 2-0) in their World Cup Asian zone group 8 qualifying</p>
<p>match in Ho Chi Minh City on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Mouminov 6, La Xuan Thang 24 own goal, Avakov 68,</p>
<p>Achourmamadov 75.</p>
<p>    Standings    P   W   D   L   F   A  Pts</p>
<p> Tajikistan	4   3   0   1  10   2   9</p>
<p> China	     3   3   0   0   8   2   9</p>
<p> Turkmenistan    3   1   0   2   4   7   3</p>
<p> Vietnam	   4   0   0   4   2  13   0</p>
<p>Playing later: China v Turkmenistan.</p>
</text>
